## Under the Hood: What They Share

Despite the UI differences, Android TV and Google TV share almost everything at the platform level:

- **Same Android base** — Both run Android (Android 9 or later)
- **Same app compatibility** — Apps built for Android TV run on Google TV and vice versa
- **Same Google Play Store** — The same app ecosystem
- **Same remote protocol** — The Android TV Remote Protocol works on both
- **Same Google Assistant integration**
- **Same Chromecast built-in**

This is the key technical insight for remote control apps: **any app that works with Android TV also works with Google TV**, because they use the same underlying network protocol for device discovery and control.

